ols3-4) is valid and covers 4 squares. Similarly, rectangle covering rows 3-4, columns 1-2 includes squares (3,1),(3,2),(4,1),(4,2) and avoids uncovered squares (3,3),(4,4). So that's another rectangle covering 4",
