ult\": \"Justification Gaps (minor missing explicit disjointness argument, but no critical errors)\",\n  \"Final Verdict\": \"PASS\",\n  \"Reasoning\": \"The answer 4048 matches the lower bound 2(N-1) and the construction achieves it; the methods are valid and the presentation only has minor gaps.\"\n}\n\nMake sure to quote final answer.\n\nNow produce final answer.",
